SUMMARY:The literature of friendship in Arab heritage
DESCRIPTION:A literary meeting that discusses the status of friendship in Arab heritage and how writers and poets expressed the values of loyalty\, sincerity\, and affection between friends\, while also exploring ways to read and understand the literature of friendship and its human and moral meanings. Main Topics The concept of friendship in Arab heritage. How to read the literature of friendship in Arab heritage.
